IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `pa-partners`

-- Partnership Act 1890, ss 1-3, 5, 7-9, 14, 17, 19, 24, 25, 32-36, 42, 44 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_partnership-act-1890.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

