§ `ss 32-34`

#ASSERT `the partnership is dissolved automatically` `the fixed term expired` FALSE
#ASSERT `the partnership is dissolved automatically` `a partner died` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the partnership is dissolved automatically` `a partner died` TRUE
#ASSERT `the partnership is dissolved automatically` `the business became unlawful` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the partnership is dissolved automatically` `a partner's share was charged for his own debt` FALSE

#ASSERT `the other partners may elect to dissolve` `a partner's share was charged for his own debt`

#ASSERT `the day of dissolution by notice` TRUE 100 90 EQUALS 100
#ASSERT `the day of dissolution by notice` FALSE 100 90 EQUALS 90

